(6281097, 928576, 124346, '<td valign="top">Really nice idea, love this kind of pictures with a concept.  I would recommend using a lower ISO as there''s some noise visible in the back.  Also a better focusing on the subjects, the male looks a little unfocused, or maybe it is that he moved just a bit.  I guess the hearts were obtained with the technique called "bokeh".  It inspired me to do some pictures like this.  Good job.</td>', 'Really nice idea, love this kind of pictures with a concept.  I would recommend using a lower ISO as there''s some noise visible in the back.  Also a better focusing on the subjects, the male looks a little unfocused, or maybe it is that he moved just a bit.  I guess the hearts were obtained with the technique called "bokeh".  It inspired me to do some pictures like this.  Good job.', '2011-01-12 08:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
