(6290366, 929209, 50864, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> How did you create this? Tell us your secrets!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This is the side of a metal utility box with peeling paint. It was the "musical notes" that caught my attention.  I don''t know what they really are-some sort of markings painted on the metal- but they were attractive.  For processing I did basic ps (curves, increase sat) and I did put it through topaz adjust. Thanks for the interest.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: How did you create this? Tell us your secrets!!   This is the side of a metal utility box with peeling paint. It was the "musical notes" that caught my attention.  I don''t know what they really are-some sort of markings painted on the metal- but they were attractive.  For processing I did basic ps (curves, increase sat) and I did put it through topaz adjust. Thanks for the interest.', '2011-01-21 21:27:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6290560, 928576, 54645, '<td valign="top">Happy to see you finally get that ribbon you''ve been searching for! Keep up the hard work, you just might ribbon again, but probably not. Don''t let it get you down, not everybody can win ribbons week after week, only the really crazy folks can pull that off. You may want to consider entering more frequently, this will increase your chances for success.</td>', 'Happy to see you finally get that ribbon you''ve been searching for! Keep up the hard work, you just might ribbon again, but probably not. Don''t let it get you down, not everybody can win ribbons week after week, only the really crazy folks can pull that off. You may want to consider entering more frequently, this will increase your chances for success.', '2011-01-22 03:51:34.000000', NULL, 0),
